.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Local IDE and editor state
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# JavaScript dependencies, build caches, and test output
node_modules/
coverage/
dist/
.cache/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Cloudflare local state
.wrangler/

# Local environment and secret files; committed examples are allowed
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.dev.vars
**/.dev.vars.*
!**/.dev.vars.example

# Repository-local disposable work area
scratch/
*.tmp.mjs

# 二进制产物不进仓库：已经进去的删不掉，只会让 clone 越来越重。
# PPT 与文档产物请放在共享盘或 Release，仓库里只留可编辑的源文件（.md/.js）。
*.pptx
*.docx
*.key

# 对话实验台的本地会话存档
apps/employee/.lab-sessions/

# 根级工具链依赖（lint / typecheck）
/node_modules/
scripts/demo-video/out/

# 路演中间产物：只留源文件（deck脚本/大纲/录制脚本）与当前成品，构建缓存不进仓库
.ppt-build/
.codex-ppt-overview/
.codex-audit/
路演/视频/out/
路演/PPT/预览/
